OPEN COMMUNITY PATCH - SETUP / REPAIR

Launch this utility after subscribing to Campaign Reimagined, or any time you want to verify the Open Community Patch installation.

This mission checks the bundled OpenShim payload, the files installed beside Battlezone, the replacement helper, and any pending or failed update status. It also writes a support-friendly diagnostic report to logs\openpatch_setup.log.

This setup build is diagnostic-only: it does not install, replace, or remove game files.
